    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Fast Virtual Tabletop For D&amp;D 5E And Online RPGs</h1>
      <p>
        Run live maps, tokens, layered table controls, drawing, and chat dice in a fast-loading browser VTT built to stay
        out of the story. For quick starts, players can join by link on simple tables without creating accounts.
      </p>
      <hr>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-links" aria-label="Page sections">
      <a href="#core-features">Core Features</a>
      <a href="#dnd-5e">D&amp;D 5E</a>
